+returns a named failure at exhaustion or an absent dependency, and validates the complete object
+before returning it. This is proof-engineering tooling, a demonstration Mini can take, not nano
+re-execution admission.
+
+**Proof contract.** The seven public theorems establish reading fidelity, factory fidelity,
+arbitrary transitive dependency coverage, refusal on missing reachable names or changed bodies,
+and distinct identities for different contexts/checkers. Reachability permits cycles and any
+finite number of expansions. Different contexts remain different even with the same statement;
+the test executes two accepted certificates witnessing that case.
